ric error messages. Always perform password comparison even when user doesn't exist to prevent timing analysis attacks.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"SECURITY\",\n      \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"title\": \"Configure JWT Token Expiration\",\n      \"description\": \"Add expiration time to JWT tokens (e.g., 15 minutes) and implement refresh token mechanism for better security. Store refresh tokens securely and provide token refresh endpoint.\",\n      \"effort\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"SECURITY\",\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"title\": \"Increase Bcrypt Salt Rounds\",\n      \"description\": \"Increase bcrypt salt rounds from 10 to at least 12 for production use. Consider making this configurable via environment variables.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"MEDIUM\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"SECURITY\",\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"title\": \"Sanitize User Responses\",\n      \"description\": \"Never return password hashes in API responses. Implement a method to exclude sensitive fields from user objects before sending responses.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"MEDIUM\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"SECURITY\",\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"title\": \"Add Password Strength Requirements\",\n      \"description\": \"Enforce strong password requirements using validation decorators. Require minimum length, complexity (uppercase, lowercase, numbers, special characters).\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"MEDIUM\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"TESTING\",\n      \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"title\": \"Add Comprehensive Unit Tests\",\n      \"description\": \"Create unit tests for AuthService covering: successful registration, duplicate email registration, successful login, invalid credentials, password hashing, JWT token generation. Aim for >80% code coverage.\",\n      \"effort\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"TESTING\",\n      \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n      \"title\": \"Add Controller Integration Tests\",\n      \"description\": \"Create e2e tests for AuthController covering: POST /auth/register with valid/invalid data, POST /auth/login with valid/invalid credentials, rate limiting behavior, validation errors.\",\n      \"effort\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"impact\": \"HIGH\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"TESTING\",\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"title\": \"Add Security-Focused Tests\",\n      \"description\": \"Create tests specifically for security scenarios: timing attack resistance, SQL injection attempts in email field, XSS attempts, token expiration validation, password strength enforcement.\",\n      \"effort\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"impact\": \"MEDIUM\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"REFACTORING\",\n      \"priority\": \"MEDIUM\",\n      \"title\": \"Extract JWT Token Generation\",\n      \"description\": \"Create a private method generateToken(user) to eliminate code duplication between register and login methods. This improves maintainability and makes future changes easier.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"MEDIUM\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"REFACTORING\",\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"title\": \"Add API Documentation\",\n      \"description\": \"Implement Swagger/OpenAPI documentation using @nestjs/swagger. Add decorators for operations, responses, and request bodies to improve API usability.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"LOW\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"REFACTORING\",\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"title\": \"Implement Centralized Configuration\",\n      \"description\": \"Move configuration values (salt rounds, JWT expiration, rate limits) to a centralized configuration module using @nestjs/config for better environment-based configuration.\",\n      \"effort\": \"SMALL\",\n      \"impact\": \"LOW\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"category\": \"PERFORMANCE\",\n      \"priority\": \"LOW\",\n      \"title\": \"Consider Async Bcrypt Operations\",\n      \"description\": \"Bcrypt operations are CPU-intensive. Consider implementing request queuing or worker threads for password hashing in high-traffic scenarios to prevent event loop blocking.\",\n      \"effort\": \"LARGE\",\n      \"impact\": \"LOW\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"reviewedAt\": \"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\",\n    \"reviewerId\": \"claude-orchestrator\",\n    \"repository\": \"airaamane/simple-todo-app\",\n    \"branch\": \"feature/authentication\",\n    \"baseBranch\": \"main\",\n    \"automatedChecks\": {\n      \"securityScan\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"performanceAnalysis\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"testCoverage\": \"COMPLETED\",\n      \"codeQuality\": \"COMPLETED\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nThis pull request introduces a JWT-based authentication system to the simple-todo-app. While the implementation demonstrates a good understanding of basic authentication patterns, there are **4 critical security issues** that must be addressed before merging:\n\n### Critical Issues:\n1. **Missing input validation** - No validation pipes or decorators to validate incoming data\n2. **No duplicate email check** - Can cause database constraint violations\n3. **Timing attack vulnerability** - Login logic reveals user existence through timing\n4. **Missing JWT token expiration** - Tokens remain valid indefinitely\n\n### Key Strengths:\n- Clean code structure following NestJS conventions\n- Proper use of bcrypt for password hashing\n- Good separation of concerns (controller, service, DTOs)\n- JWT integration is correctly implemented\n\n### Recommendation:\n**REQUEST CHANGES** - The security vulnerabilities must be fixed before this PR can be merged. The issues are well-documented and relatively straightforward to address. Once the critical and high-priority security issues are resolved, this will be a solid foundation for the authentication system."